# .dvcignore  [What Data Version Control (DVC) never scans]
# -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Stage 3   The local pipeline gains data-version checks; exclude Python caches from those scans
#           Cache changes must not look like changed training inputs
# Purpose   Keep changing Python caches out of DVC dependency scans
# Patterns  __pycache__/ and *.pyc, as in golden repo 3
# Used by   DVC when checking dependencies and reproducing the pipeline
# Why       Cache changes are not changes to the pipeline's inputs
